DESCRIPTION:Hoozay’s Salvi Comedy Jam is coming to Chandler\, AZ Mic Drop
  for one unforgettable night of comedy!\n\nCreated and headlined by comedia
 n Hoozay\, the Salvi Comedy Jam brings together some of the funniest Salvad
 oran and Latino comedians for a night celebrating our culture\, our familie
 s\, through comedy.\n\nFeaturing Sergio Melgar\, with Hoozay closing out th
 e night.\n\nWhether you’re Salvadoran\, Latino\, or just love great comed
 y\, come ready to laugh. Bring your friends\, bring your family\, and bring
  that one tía who has an opinion about everything. Warning the show may co
 ntain Spanish.\n\nAges 17+\n\nFee applies if transferring confirmed ticket 
 purchase to another guest.\n\nDoors for open for seating approximately 30 m
 inutes before late showtimes. Please note\, doors are subject to prior show
  endtime and may change without notice\, beyond our control.\n\nNo refunds 
 or exchanges.\n\nTicket resale is strictly prohibited. Any tickets purchase
 d or listed on a third-party resale website or platform is a direct violati
 on of our Venue Policies and will not be honored\, resulting in denied admi
 ssion. Third party resale websites and platforms include but are not limite
 d to StubHub\, Vivid Seats\, Seat Geek\, eTickets\, Event Tickets Center\, 
 GoTickets\, Craigslist\, OfferUp\, Facebook Marketplace\, etc.\n\nWaitlists
  are available for sold out shows. To join the Waitlist\, you must be prese
 nt at the venue prior to showtime on the day of the event. You will need to
  provide your name and how many tickets you'd like to purchase. About 10-15
  minutes after the show starts\, we will go through our showroom and find t
 he empty seats available and sell tickets in order of arrival.\nMore info: 
 https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/hoozay-s-salvi-comedy-jam/
